sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant Relay as Lambda relay
    participant Q as SQS queue
    participant W as Cerberus worker
    participant R as Router
    participant S as K8s sandbox
    participant LLM as Specialist LLM
    participant PR as PR comment

    Dev->>GH: open or push PR
    GH->>Relay: webhook
    Relay->>Q: enqueue event
    Q-->>W: worker polls
    W->>R: (repo, changed paths, diff)
    R-->>W: roster of skills to run
    W->>S: allocate sandbox
    S->>LLM: run each skill
    LLM-->>S: findings
    S-->>W: pass complete
    W->>PR: post comment
